      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sample Prefab: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/488466987849089044/713822771838451813/audiotest.unitypackage\nIf you drop this into an SDK2 world, the audio is forced 3D.  If you drop it into an SDK3 world it works as expected. \nPreview.  Inside the inner blue sphere, it should be 2D audio.  Once you leave the blue sphere, it fades into 3D audio and then is silent once you leave the red sphere: \nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/488466987849089044/713822944400244808/unknown.png",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
