      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So, this may have been an odd unity caching issue, after all.  If anyone else comes across a similar issue, I managed to fix it by copying the audio source component, deleting the game object, saving, then creating a new game object and pasting the same audio source back onto it again.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
